    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d537">

                <pb facs="0668" n="554" sameAs="frus:frus1924v01/pg554"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">493.11/997</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chinese Minister</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Sze</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-06-14"><hi rendition="#italic">June 14,
                        1924</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to enclose herewith a copy
                    of an act of Congress, approved May 21, 1924, whereby the President is
                    authorized, in his discretion, to remit to China the balance of the Boxer
                    Indemnity, such remission to begin as from October 1, 1917, and to be at such
                    times and in such manner as the President shall deem just, the intent of the
                    Congress, as stated in the preamble to the Act, being further to develop the
                    educational and other cultural activities of China.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles E. Hughes</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d537-a1.xml" xpointer="d537-a1"/>
            </div>
